WEBVTT

00:03.920 --> 00:04.790
<b>So cute!</b>

00:06.250 --> 00:06.960
<b>Touching!</b>

00:09.250 --> 00:10.080
<b>So cool!</b>

00:11.290 --> 00:12.040
<b>Charming!</b>

00:20.290 --> 00:25.580
<b>Sunny like the light above, shining bright</b>

00:25.580 --> 00:30.920
<b>That warm, happy smile is so perfect and right</b>

00:31.080 --> 00:36.330
<b>Even when you're sad and tears roll down your cheeks</b>

00:36.460 --> 00:41.250
<b>That's part of what makes you perfect to me</b>

00:41.630 --> 00:46.830
<b>All I can do right now is look up at you in the sky</b>

00:47.000 --> 00:55.040
<b>But I believe in the strength growing in my heart</b>

00:55.170 --> 00:57.630
<b>I'm not just gushing over you</b>

00:57.880 --> 01:00.250
<b>I'm not just dreaming about being you</b>

01:00.420 --> 01:03.080
<b>I want to be, I want to change</b>

01:03.250 --> 01:05.750
<b>This love will power me through it all</b>

01:06.000 --> 01:12.170
<b>It all started that day you stole my heart</b>

01:12.170 --> 01:18.710
<b>My love will never fade, My Dream Girls</b>

01:19.000 --> 01:19.960
<b>So cute!</b>

01:21.290 --> 01:22.080
<b>Touching!</b>

01:24.380 --> 01:25.210
<b>So cool!</b>

01:26.380 --> 01:27.210
<b>Charming!</b>

01:31.500 --> 01:35.210
<b>Supreme Commander Magia Baiser Calls the Shots</b>

01:32.380 --> 01:34.170
<b>Okay, golems!</b>

01:34.630 --> 01:37.040
<b>That beam goes over here!</b>

01:38.130 --> 01:41.960
<b>Why the hell do we gotta clean up their mess?</b>

01:41.960 --> 01:43.960
<b>Sulfur-san, close your legs!</b>

01:44.130 --> 01:49.290
<b>I'm sorry, but the citizens need our help...</b>

01:49.750 --> 01:53.750
<b>I'm surprised we haven't seen Enormita since then...</b>

01:53.750 --> 01:54.750
<b>You're right.</b>

01:56.380 --> 01:58.000
<b>Looks like the gang's all here.</b>

01:58.580 --> 02:01.210
<b>Or should I say, the new Enormita.</b>

02:01.880 --> 02:04.380
<b>Why'd you make us come all the way here?</b>

02:04.880 --> 02:06.170
<b>SERGEANT OF SNEAKY SUBTERFUGE</b>

02:04.880 --> 02:06.170
<b>LEBERBLUME</b>

02:06.670 --> 02:10.080
<b>And why do we all have these weird titles?</b>

02:10.710 --> 02:12.170
<b>ADMIRAL OF ASPIRING IDOL ACTIVITIES</b>

02:10.710 --> 02:12.170
<b>LOCO MUSICA</b>

02:12.330 --> 02:17.880
<b>Hey! I put a lotta thought into those!
Whaddya mean you don't like 'em?!</b>

02:18.330 --> 02:19.670
<b>CAPTAIN OF THE MAGIA BAISER</b>

02:18.330 --> 02:19.670
<b>LOVE AND APPRECIATION SQUAD</b>

02:18.340 --> 02:19.670
<b>LEOPARDE</b>

02:23.330 --> 02:24.670
<b>COLONEL OF CATNAPS</b>

02:23.330 --> 02:24.670
<b>NEROALICE</b>

02:25.500 --> 02:28.460
<b>SUPREME COMMANDER</b>

02:25.500 --> 02:28.460
<b>OF ENORMITA</b>

02:26.250 --> 02:28.460
<b>MAGIA BAISER</b>

02:27.170 --> 02:28.880
<b>Does she even want to be here?!</b>

02:28.880 --> 02:32.000
<b>You okay, Utena-chan?! Want some titty?!</b>

02:32.000 --> 02:33.670
<b>Up and at 'em, Commander!</b>

02:37.130 --> 02:38.080
<b>Speak up!</b>

02:38.920 --> 02:43.040
<b>Sorry. My brain is tired.</b>

02:43.330 --> 02:44.880
<b>Y-your what?</b>

02:45.130 --> 02:53.000
<b>I used my brain to morph Lord into a little girl.
That took a lot out of me...</b>

02:53.460 --> 02:56.130
<b>Didn't know that was so exhausting...</b>

02:56.880 --> 03:00.290
<b>I had to do it... To beat her.</b>

03:00.710 --> 03:06.290
<b>But even though she's gone,
it won't bring back the magical girls she hunted down...</b>

03:07.630 --> 03:09.880
<b>I got revenge... But gained nothing.</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:12.460
<b>You sure you should be leading an evil organization?</b>

03:13.170 --> 03:21.580
<b>I'd hoped we could talk about our battle plans,
but Utena might be too out of it.</b>

03:21.880 --> 03:24.170
<b>You mean for battling the Tres Magia?</b>

03:24.330 --> 03:25.130
<b>Yup.</b>

03:25.750 --> 03:28.630
<b>Y'know, I haven't seen them around lately.</b>

03:29.130 --> 03:32.080
<b>My darlings... I need them.</b>

03:32.290 --> 03:34.210
<b>It hurts. I'm so depressed.</b>

03:34.750 --> 03:37.250
<b>I'm so worried about Azure.</b>

03:37.250 --> 03:39.710
<b>What if... What if I really did break her?</b>

03:40.670 --> 03:45.330
<b>Meh, we're so strong now,
we could take 'em out in our sleep!</b>

03:45.830 --> 03:48.210
<b>I wouldn't be so sure.</b>

03:49.750 --> 03:52.790
<b>We should be careful next time we run into them.</b>

03:53.250 --> 03:54.880
<b>Why's that?</b>

03:55.040 --> 03:57.630
<b>We ran into the Tres Magia.</b>

03:57.830 --> 04:01.420
<b>What?! Wh-where?! Where'd you see them?!</b>

04:01.420 --> 04:05.250
<b>Right before we came to find you!
We saw all three of them!</b>

04:05.880 --> 04:10.750
<b>Thank God. The Tres Magia
make the world worth living in...</b>

04:10.750 --> 04:11.830
<b>Calm down.</b>

04:12.000 --> 04:14.790
<b>So why do we gotta watch out for them now?</b>

04:14.790 --> 04:18.130
<b>You should've seen Azure.
She was the scariest out of all of 'em.</b>

04:18.710 --> 04:22.580
<b>She took on Lord's monsters by herself
and killed every last one.</b>

04:22.880 --> 04:26.080
<b>And she'd transformed into some new form...</b>

04:27.670 --> 04:29.500
<b>Wh-why are you screaming?!</b>

04:29.790 --> 04:32.130
<b>Please, no spoilers.</b>

04:32.130 --> 04:34.710
<b>It's not a spoiler, it's an important field report!</b>

04:34.710 --> 04:38.460
<b>I don't wanna hear it. I'll see it myself.</b>

04:38.460 --> 04:40.540
<b>How are we supposed to battle them, then?</b>

04:40.670 --> 04:44.130
<b>Quit it. You know she's not gonna listen.</b>

04:44.130 --> 04:45.920
<b>Ugh, I know.</b>

04:47.420 --> 04:52.460
<b>I gotta find them... I gotta see them.
All this news is driving me crazy...</b>

04:52.630 --> 04:54.210
<b>Funny you should mention them,</b>

04:54.420 --> 04:59.210
<b>cause they're out in the city,
helping rebuild the places you guys destroyed.</b>

04:59.210 --> 05:01.380
<b>Why didn't you tell me that earlier?!</b>

05:02.250 --> 05:04.670
<b>Sorry, everyone, I've gotta go.</b>

05:05.210 --> 05:10.290
<b>Seeing them might help you get back
to your normal self, too.</b>

05:10.540 --> 05:13.420
<b>I wanna go with Utena-chan!</b>

05:13.420 --> 05:16.040
<b>Nope, you're still healing up.</b>

05:16.170 --> 05:19.750
<b>Oh, leave your transformation item with me
so you don't out yourself.</b>

05:19.750 --> 05:20.580
<b>Okay.</b>

05:21.960 --> 05:23.670
<b>All right, everyone!</b>

05:24.080 --> 05:26.080
<b>Great meeting!</b>

05:26.540 --> 05:28.630
<b>This coulda been an email...</b>

05:34.330 --> 05:38.540
<b>I'm finally seeing the damage... We did all this?</b>

05:38.540 --> 05:41.290
<b>I-it does kinda hurt to see...</b>

05:50.500 --> 05:55.000
<b>Hey, is it okay if I help?</b>

05:59.880 --> 06:03.290
<b>I know this doesn't erase what we've done...</b>

06:05.330 --> 06:07.380
<b>But I've got to do SOMETHING...</b>

06:07.880 --> 06:08.880
<b>You, there.</b>

06:10.130 --> 06:11.330
<b>What are you doing?</b>

06:15.460 --> 06:17.130
<b>Wait, that's Utena Hiiragi-san...</b>

06:17.460 --> 06:21.630
<b>You're... Azure!</b>

06:23.500 --> 06:24.500
<b>You're bleeding!</b>

06:24.830 --> 06:27.000
<b>A-are you okay, miss?!</b>

06:27.330 --> 06:31.250
<b>S-sorry, my brain just kinda
stopped working for a second.</b>

06:31.250 --> 06:32.130
<b>Huh?!</b>

06:32.460 --> 06:36.880
<b>A..Azure-san, are you doing okay?</b>

06:36.880 --> 06:41.130
<b>I-I should be asking that of you... But yes, I'm all right.</b>

06:41.750 --> 06:46.380
<b>Could I... Shake your hand?</b>

06:47.540 --> 06:49.710
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

06:54.170 --> 06:57.040
<b>I wish I could shed my skin.</b>

06:57.040 --> 06:57.960
<b>Why?!</b>

06:57.960 --> 07:01.460
<b>Then I could save your touch forever...</b>

07:03.460 --> 07:09.500
<b>Anyway, I'm really impressed.
You don't need to help rebuild, too...</b>

07:11.500 --> 07:12.960
<b>I'd say we do.</b>

07:13.210 --> 07:18.290
<b>Fighting evil and protecting this city
and its people is our job.</b>

07:20.460 --> 07:26.670
<b>Yet we allowed the city
to come to so much harm. This is our fault.</b>

07:28.380 --> 07:29.630
<b>But I swear...</b>

07:31.080 --> 07:34.130
<b>We'll never let this happen again.</b>

07:37.000 --> 07:39.420
<b>And we'll stop Enormita, whatever it takes!</b>

07:43.040 --> 07:45.170
<b>Sorry, I shouldn't have gone on and on...</b>

07:50.580 --> 07:52.420
<b>I see it now!</b>

07:52.420 --> 07:54.960
<b>Wh-what's wrong?!
</b><b>Azure isn't broken at all!</b><b></b>

07:55.380 --> 08:04.040
<b>How could I be so stupid? Magical girls won't break,
because magical girls NEVER break!</b>

08:05.210 --> 08:07.250
<b>A-are you okay?</b>

08:07.630 --> 08:10.330
<b>Yes! I'm more than okay!</b>

08:11.790 --> 08:16.380
<b>Now I can play the villain without any fear!</b>

08:19.580 --> 08:24.130
<b>Wow! The city's all back to normal!</b>

08:24.130 --> 08:26.710
<b>Our golems did most of the work.</b>

08:28.880 --> 08:32.210
<b>And you helped, too, miss, ah...</b>

08:32.210 --> 08:34.670
<b>I'm Utena Hiiragi!</b>

08:35.960 --> 08:37.630
<b>Thank you, Utena-san.</b>

08:37.960 --> 08:40.420
<b>She said my name...</b>

08:40.420 --> 08:43.630
<b>Right, we'd better get going.</b>

08:45.790 --> 08:48.630
<b>All that work really tired me out.</b>

08:52.460 --> 08:54.170
<b>Hey, uh...</b>

08:55.580 --> 08:58.750
<b>I-if you want...</b>

09:01.790 --> 09:06.000
<b>Are you sure? You must be tired, too, Utena-san.</b>

09:06.330 --> 09:08.460
<b>Nope! I'm not tired anymore!</b>

09:08.460 --> 09:09.830
<b>R-really?</b>

09:10.210 --> 09:12.420
<b>If that's so, I'll happily accept your offer.</b>

09:13.040 --> 09:14.130
<b>Okay!</b>

09:15.460 --> 09:19.790
<b>I've never done this without being transformed before...</b>

09:20.170 --> 09:22.580
<b>Okay, here I go...</b>

09:24.960 --> 09:26.670
<b>She's so soft!</b>

09:28.790 --> 09:31.290
<b>S-sorry, did that hurt?!</b>

09:31.290 --> 09:34.250
<b>N-no, it felt really good.</b>

09:35.500 --> 09:37.920
<b>Why does this feel so familiar?</b>

09:38.170 --> 09:44.540
<b>Thank you. Your lower back's probably achy,
so let me massage there, too.</b>

09:49.420 --> 09:52.630
<b>Let's see, next...</b>

09:57.080 --> 09:59.380
<b>Utena-san?! You don't need to...</b>

10:00.830 --> 10:06.420
<b>W-wow, you're really stiff here, too!</b>

10:06.630 --> 10:08.630
<b>H-hold on a sec...</b>

10:13.130 --> 10:21.670
<b>I gotta knead the tension out of everywhere,
or you'll still be sore...</b>

10:34.170 --> 10:36.000
<b>Wait, Utena-san!</b>

10:36.000 --> 10:40.750
<b>I'm gonna give you a nice, thorough massage...</b>

10:42.420 --> 10:44.130
<b>That's enough!</b>

10:45.170 --> 10:47.830
<b>Stop... No more!</b>

11:10.420 --> 11:15.130
<b>I'm... I, uh...</b>

11:16.710 --> 11:23.580
<b>I-I'm sorry! I'm just gonna... I gotta go!</b>

11:25.210 --> 11:27.710
<b>The way she used her fingers...</b>

11:29.380 --> 11:33.500
<b>Th-thank God I didn't have
my transformation item with me...</b>

11:33.830 --> 11:36.170
<b>or else I would've been in real trouble!</b>

11:44.790 --> 11:46.920
<b>Another meeting already?</b>

11:47.130 --> 11:49.880
<b>Why do you care? You're not doing anything.</b>

11:49.880 --> 11:51.380
<b>Neither are you!</b>

11:51.380 --> 11:53.960
<b>Do you guys ever get tired of arguing?</b>

11:53.960 --> 11:55.000
<b>Girls.</b>

11:56.250 --> 11:59.920
<b>Thank you for assembling on such short notice.</b>

12:00.830 --> 12:02.250
<b>Utena-chan.</b>

12:02.500 --> 12:05.000
<b>No... Baiser-chan.</b>

12:05.790 --> 12:09.420
<b>I will now present to you our next plan of attack.</b>

12:09.670 --> 12:11.040
<b>She's different...</b>

12:11.040 --> 12:13.170
<b>Way different than she was acting before!</b>

12:13.460 --> 12:15.630
<b>Baiser-chan's getting serious.</b>

12:17.380 --> 12:24.500
<b>I had the opportunity to speak with a member
of the Tres Magia and confirm their intentions.</b>

12:24.670 --> 12:29.040
<b>Quote, "We'll stop Enormita, whatever it takes."</b>

12:29.290 --> 12:34.670
<b>If they plan on stopping us,
then our path forward is clear.</b>

12:36.960 --> 12:39.290
<b>The plan is simple:</b>

12:40.500 --> 12:48.880
<b>We'll play the perfect villains, fight them all-out,
make them suffer a little bit, then withdraw!</b>

12:50.710 --> 12:53.380
<b>You're a genius, Baiser-chan!</b>

12:53.380 --> 12:55.040
<b>Do you even hear yourself?!</b>

12:55.380 --> 12:57.920
<b>She just wants to have her fun.</b>

12:59.960 --> 13:02.420
<b>Seriously, what's wrong with her?</b>

13:02.670 --> 13:06.500
<b>She wants us to "play" the villain and that's it?</b>

13:07.250 --> 13:10.290
<b>What about my dream to be an idol, huh?</b>

13:10.290 --> 13:13.250
<b>Nothing we can do. She's the boss.</b>

13:13.670 --> 13:15.380
<b>We chose her, anyway.</b>

13:15.380 --> 13:16.920
<b>Yeah, I know.</b>

13:16.920 --> 13:18.250
<b>Yes, I beat it!</b>

13:18.460 --> 13:22.830
<b>Are you done? Seriously,
did you come over just to play games?</b>

13:22.830 --> 13:26.130
<b>I got bored in the middle of all your bitching.</b>

13:26.130 --> 13:27.540
<b>Excuse me?!</b>

13:28.500 --> 13:30.960
<b>C'mon, then, let's go shopping.</b>

13:34.540 --> 13:36.380
<b>What're you getting today?</b>

13:36.380 --> 13:39.330
<b>A new swimsuit! I gotta stay up with the trends, y'know.</b>

13:40.920 --> 13:43.540
<b>We made it! The toy store!</b>

13:45.290 --> 13:48.420
<b>Remember, you can pick whatever you want.</b>

13:48.420 --> 13:54.670
<b>You lost a lot of toys in the battle with Lord,
so hopefully this makes up for it...</b>

13:56.460 --> 14:00.130
<b>Okay, Korisu, let's get to pickin!</b>

14:00.130 --> 14:03.630
<b>Stop, Kiwi-chan! Don't run in the store!</b>

14:09.630 --> 14:12.500
<b>Find something you like, Korisu-chan?</b>

14:14.380 --> 14:16.920
<b>Th-those are so cute!</b>

14:17.420 --> 14:20.040
<b>I loved playing with those when I was little.</b>

14:22.630 --> 14:24.460
<b>"You got good taste!"</b>

14:24.790 --> 14:26.750
<b>Korisu-chan and Utena-chan?</b>

14:27.500 --> 14:30.380
<b>Hey, fancy meeting you here!</b>

14:30.830 --> 14:35.540
<b>Haruka-chan? Wait, how do you know Korisu-chan?</b>

14:35.540 --> 14:38.460
<b>Oh, we played together at the park before.</b>

14:38.460 --> 14:39.750
<b>Right?</b>

14:40.710 --> 14:43.670
<b>I didn't know you knew her, too, Utena-chan.</b>

14:43.670 --> 14:47.710
<b>Yeah, we're friends. So, uh...</b>

14:47.920 --> 14:51.040
<b>Oh, these are my little sisters!</b>

14:51.040 --> 14:52.040
<b>Natsuna!</b>

14:52.040 --> 14:52.960
<b>Akiho!</b>

14:52.960 --> 14:53.830
<b>Mifuyu!</b>

14:53.830 --> 14:56.830
<b>I didn't know you had little sisters!</b>

14:56.830 --> 14:59.330
<b>Yep! They're triplets!</b>

14:59.880 --> 15:00.580
<b>Whoa!</b>

15:01.130 --> 15:03.250
<b>Damn, someone knocked you up, Haruka?!</b>

15:03.540 --> 15:04.960
<b>They're my sisters!</b>

15:04.960 --> 15:06.920
<b>Where have you been, Kiwi-chan?</b>

15:07.380 --> 15:12.920
<b>Oh man, Utena-chan,
Korisu's gonna love this thing I found for her!</b>

15:16.630 --> 15:19.630
<b>Transform! Ultrama'am!</b>

15:21.630 --> 15:23.330
<b>That's your reaction?!</b>

15:23.460 --> 15:24.210
<b>Cool!</b>

15:24.210 --> 15:24.880
<b>Cool!</b>

15:24.880 --> 15:25.830
<b>Cool!</b>

15:26.040 --> 15:27.290
<b>See?!</b>

15:30.290 --> 15:33.080
<b>Sheesh, so she DOES like it after all.</b>

15:35.000 --> 15:37.420
<b>Everything's so peaceful today.</b>

15:38.130 --> 15:42.960
<b>I wish every day was like today.</b>

15:43.710 --> 15:46.920
<b>Y'know, enjoyable and quiet.</b>

15:49.000 --> 15:50.540
<b>I get that.</b>

15:50.540 --> 15:53.000
<b>Yeah, me, too.</b>

15:53.670 --> 15:55.830
<b>Okay, see you later!</b>

15:55.830 --> 15:57.170
<b>Bye-bye!</b>

15:57.750 --> 15:59.880
<b>Lates!</b>

15:59.880 --> 16:02.960
<b>I'm glad you found something, Korisu-chan.</b>

16:04.250 --> 16:05.920
<b>Alice-chan?!</b>

16:05.920 --> 16:06.880
<b>Here we go.</b>

16:06.880 --> 16:10.460
<b>Y-you shouldn't transform whenever you want, or...</b>

16:15.380 --> 16:16.460
<b>What was that?!</b>

16:23.630 --> 16:25.540
<b>What IS that?!</b>

16:30.670 --> 16:33.540
<b>Damn, that's badass!</b>

16:33.540 --> 16:35.920
<b>A..Alice-chan, stop!</b>

16:36.250 --> 16:38.960
<b>They just fixed the city!</b>

16:41.040 --> 16:42.790
<b>"Nope, not gonna stop."</b>

16:43.040 --> 16:47.170
<b>Th-then at least try not to knock down any buildings!</b>

16:47.630 --> 16:49.500
<b>Haruka, I sense Enormita!</b>

16:49.790 --> 16:50.830
<b>Yep!</b>

16:50.830 --> 16:52.630
<b>We're on our way!</b>

16:53.920 --> 16:56.630
<b>You again, Enormita?!</b>

16:57.710 --> 17:00.710
<b>How dare you terrify everyone with a giant monster?!</b>

17:01.790 --> 17:03.500
<b>Stop this, right now!</b>

17:05.500 --> 17:09.130
<b>Yes! This is what magical girls are all about!</b>

17:09.130 --> 17:11.210
<b>Why are you so damn excited?!</b>

17:11.880 --> 17:13.540
<b>Let's get this over with!</b>

17:17.630 --> 17:20.460
<b>Transform! Ultrama'am!</b>

17:22.290 --> 17:23.710
<b>What...?!</b>

17:38.420 --> 17:39.250
<b>Wha-?</b>

17:40.130 --> 17:42.460
<b>What happened to me?!</b>

17:42.960 --> 17:46.380
<b>St-stop taking pictures and run away already!</b>

17:54.630 --> 17:56.040
<b>They'll see my undies!</b>

17:56.420 --> 17:58.710
<b>No, I've gotta protect them!</b>

18:12.920 --> 18:14.630
<b>Get his ass, Magenta!</b>

18:14.630 --> 18:16.170
<b>Keep it up!</b>

18:16.420 --> 18:18.380
<b>This ain't good, Baiser-chan.</b>

18:18.960 --> 18:21.580
<b>Yes, Alice-chan is in danger.</b>

18:22.250 --> 18:25.080
<b>I suppose we'll have to help her.</b>

